    <!-- BOLTFLASHED PIECES -->
    <h2 class="section-heading">Boltflashed Pieces</h2>
    <div class="intro-row">
      <div class="portrait-area">
        <img alt="Boltflashed Pieces" src="https://catalog.jonsarkin.com/files/large/1571d1a647482295135fbb142e159c73d8ba17ff.jpg" />
      </div>
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>For decades, Sarkin compulsively stuffed envelopes with drawings and mailed them unsolicited to strangers, critics, and public figures &mdash; a practice he called <em>boltflashing</em>. Known recipients include the New Yorker critic Calvin Tomkins (whose pieces are now in the MoMA Archives), the Eisner Award&ndash;winning cartoonist Tony Millionaire, and director Joel Schumacher. Many remain in unknown hands.</p>
        <a class="bio-link" href="https://catalog.jonsarkin.com/s/catalog/item-set/7491">View the catalog set &rarr;</a>
        <div class="boltflash-cta" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
          <p>Did you receive unsolicited artwork from Jon Sarkin? <a href="&#109;&#97;&#105;&#108;&#116;&#111;&#58;&#97;&#114;&#116;&#64;&#106;&#111;&#110;&#115;&#97;&#114;&#107;&#105;&#110;&#46;&#99;&#111;&#109;">Contact the estate</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CURRENTLY AVAILABLE -->
    <h2 class="section-heading">Currently Available</h2>
    <div class="body-text">
      <p>A current selection from the estate. The full inventory is in <a href="/collections/all">Available Works</a>.</p>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Shows only works that are still available: pinned handles first (if
      any are set in the theme editor), then the rest of the collection, up
      to the card count. Works at or above the price cap (the Alphabet set)
      stay in Available Works but don't lead the homepage.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign featured_max = section.settings.featured_count | default: 4
      assign featured_cap_cents = section.settings.featured_max_price | default: 5000 | times: 100
      assign featured_shown = 0
      assign featured_seen = ','
      assign featured_pins = section.settings.pinned_handles | default: '' | split: ','
    -%}
    <div class="product-grid product-grid--featured">
      {%- for handle in featured_pins -%}
        {%- assign handle_clean = handle | strip -%}
        {%- if handle_clean == blank or featured_shown >= featured_max -%}{%- continue -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign featured_product = all_products[handle_clean] -%}
        {%- if featured_product != blank and featured_product.available -%}
          {%- render 'product-card', product: featured_product -%}
          {%- assign featured_shown = featured_shown | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- assign featured_seen = featured_seen | append: featured_product.handle | append: ',' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- for featured_product in collections.all.products -%}
        {%- if featured_shown >= featured_max -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign featured_key = ',' | append: featured_product.handle | append: ',' -%}
        {%- if featured_product.available and featured_product.price < featured_cap_cents -%}
          {%- unless featured_seen contains featured_key -%}
            {%- render 'product-card', product: featured_product -%}
            {%- assign featured_shown = featured_shown | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- endunless -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>

    {%- render 'release-signup', source: 'home' -%}

